<title>USA: TF Financial acquires 3 Cenlar offices.</title>
<headline>TF Financial acquires 3 Cenlar offices.</headline>
<dateline>NEWTOWN, Pa. 1996-09-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>TF Financial Corp said Monday that it had acquired three New Jersey branch offices of Cenlar Federal Savings Bank.</p>
<p>The company said in a release Monday that the acquisition, which closed on September 20, provides TF Financial the opportunity to extend banking services to New Jersey.</p>
